    "result": "Excellent! I've successfully added weekly subscription support to subtrack. Here's a summary of the changes:\n\n## What was added:\n\n**Weekly subscriptions** now work alongside monthly and yearly plans:\n\n```bash\nsubtrack add \"Meal kit\" 59.90 --every week  # \u2713 Works!\n```\n\n### Implementation details:\n- **Monthly cost calculation**: `price \u00d7 52 \u00f7 12` (rounded to nearest cent)\n  - \u20ac59.90/week = \u20ac259.56/month\n- **Billing schedule**: Charges every 7 days from first charge (`--since`)\n- **`subtrack renewals`**: Lists weekly charges alongside other plans\n- **`subtrack export`**: Includes weekly cycles in CSV with calculated monthly costs\n\n### Changes made:\n1. **cycles.js** - Added weekly cycle with 7-day intervals\n2. **bin/subtrack.js** - Updated CLI to accept `--every week`\n3. **export.js** - Updated CSV export for weekly plans\n4. **renewals.js** - Fixed sorting bug (was sorting by string, now sorts by date)\n5. **Tests** - Added 5 new tests for weekly functionality\n\n**All 39 tests pass**, including the new weekly subscription tests. The feature is fully functional and ready to use.",
